{"task": "IG-2B04", "path": "docs/work/EVIDENCE.md", "start_line": 1, "lines": ["# Run evidence examples", "", "These are shapes for operator/executor records, not evidence of a completed task.", "Save each attempt under `private/workflow/runs/<task>/<attempt>/`. Never overwrite a", "previous attempt or fabricate model settings, checks, reviewer identity or owner decisions.", "", "A checkpoint records task/attempt, input packet path/hash, source revisions, base and", "current hashes of owned files, completed criteria, commands/exits, current blocker,", "and the next exact operation. Keep actual model/reasoning and observed token counts", "null with a reason until verified. Do not include secrets or unrelated session history.", "", "An executor claim may reference the checkpoint as its first artifact. A delivery manifest", "lists every changed product/test/contract file submitted for review plus relevant reports;", "it must not be limited to a prose summary. Hash the bytes actually reviewed. Independent", "review and coordinator acceptance reference that same frozen artifact list.", "", "```json", "{", "  \"role\": \"executor\",", "  \"actor\": \"operator-assigned-session-identity\",", "  \"summary\": \"Describe the concrete claim or delivery\",", "  \"model\": null,", "  \"reasoning\": null,", "  \"configuration_evidence\": \"Unknown until confirmed by runtime metadata or operator UI observation\",", "  \"criteria\": [\"Copy the exact acceptance criteria covered by this evidence\"],", "  \"artifacts\": [", "    {\"path\": \"private/workflow/runs/IG-1A/attempt-1/checkpoint.json\", \"sha256\": \"replace-with-computed-hash\"}", "  ],", "  \"checks\": [", "    {\"command\": \"replace-with-actually-run-command\", \"exit_code\": null}", "  ],", "  \"measurement\": {", "    \"started_utc\": null,", "    \"ended_utc\": null,", "    \"wall_seconds\": null,", "    \"operator_seconds\": null,", "    \"input_tokens\": null,", "    \"output_tokens\": null,", "    \"unknown_reason\": \"Not observed in this example\"", "  }", "}", "```", "", "This example intentionally cannot claim a task or pass a delivery gate. Fill measured", "values and hashes first. For an in-progress claim, confirmed model must be `gpt-6.1-sol`", "and reasoning `high`. For accepted, role is reviewer with a distinct identity, all exact", "task criteria, matching delivery artifacts and passing checks. For done, role is coordinator.", "", "A task requiring semantic acceptance additionally references `semantic_decision`, the", "path of an immutable JSON record with role human_owner or human_reviewer, actor,", "authorization evidence, exact targets/revisions/aspects, basis, decision accepted, and", "decision_artifact pointing to the actual human statement. The tool checks structure and", "hashes; it does not authenticate people. The coordinator must verify the recorded", "authority and scope against the real statement. Model-authored approval is invalid.", "", "```powershell", ".\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe scripts/workflow.py transition --task IG-1A --to in_progress --evidence private/workflow/runs/IG-1A/attempt-1/claim.json", "```", "", "The example command is for a future executor session. No transition was made to the", "real implementation queue during plan preparation. Synthetic transition tests use", "temporary copies and leave the real queue unchanged."], "truncated": false}

